## Decision Framework

| Scenario | Decision | Action |
|----------|----------|--------|
| Primary workflow blocks | Escalate | Contact {{ escalation_contact }} |
| Resource unavailable | Replan | Move start by {{ replan_slip_weeks }} weeks |
| New blocker discovered | Assess | Add to blocked list, re-evaluate critical path |
| Quick win opportunity | Prioritize | Run parallel to primary workflow |
| Health score drops < 40 | Halt | Pause workflow, investigate root cause |

